	"system": {
		"description": {
			"value": "<p><em>Rolling bones, reading splatter patterns, laying out ornate cards, or employing some other divining tool, you seek guidance on which path to take.</em></p><p><strong>Materials:</strong> You require a set of <em>@UUID[Compendium.elkan5e.elkan5e-spells.Item.jWPz8vlkooFW63xi]{Augury Bones}</em> or something similar, typically valued at 25 gold.</p><p><strong>Utility</strong></p><ul><li><p>You immediately learn the fastest route on foot to your chosen location. This path is not necessarily safe or reliable.</p></li><li><p><strong>Failure Conditions: </strong>If the named destination is on another plane, is unreachable by foot or mobile (e.g., a flying fortress), or isn’t specific (e.g., “a green dragon’s lair”), the spell fails. </p></li><li><p>The spell also ends early if there is a change in terrain or available paths that makes your route no longer functional.</p></li></ul>",
			"chat": ""
		},
